  << /ActualText ( \050\050TOOLS\057SKILLS\050Data Analytics\072\050Looker Studios\050Power BI\050AWS Redshift\050\050ERP\057CRM Systems\057Accounting\057Ecommerce\072\050Zoho Inventory\054 Sage 300\054 Katana\050Hubspot\054 QBO\050Shopify\054 Sparklayer\050\050LLM\057AI Technologies\072\050Claude\054 Gemini\054 OpenAI\050\050Coding\057Automations\072\050Google Appscript\050Microsoft Visual Basic\050SQL \050AWS Redshift\051\050Zapier\054 APIs\054 Webhooks\050\050Supply Chain Strategy\072\050Demand Planning\057Forecasting\050Inventory Optimization\050Procurement\050Transportation \050Supplier Management\0503rd Party Partnerships \050Logistics \046 Warehouse\051\050\050Lean Six Sigma\057Process Improvement\072\0505S\054 5 Whys\054 RCAs\nPDCA\054 VSM\054 SIPOC\050Pareto Analysis\054 FMEAs\050SOP Development\n\nProject Management\072\nAirtable \050Asana\050Figma \050Prototyping\051\050Miro Boards\050Pivotal Tracker\n\050CERTIFICATIONS\nLean Six Sigma Green Belt \050ASQ\051\nGoogle UX Design Specialization\n\nEDUCATION\050M\056S\056 Industrial Technology\050Pittsburg State University\054 KS\054 USA\050\050)
