969 0 obj
  << /ActualText (WORK EXPERIENCE\nAutomation \046 Systems Consultant \050Contractor\051\050All Max Nutrition \023 Toronto\054 Canada \174 Jan 2026\055 Current\050\050Projects\072\nAutomated Reports \055 Forecasting\054 Low Stock\n Building ERP layer connecting \055 Inventory\054 Logistics and Label Departments\050\nHighlights\072\nTurned 3 day manual process into a 1\055click \0503min run\051 \222 automated data integration across Sage SQL servers\054 and Excel\nEnabled clear tracking of orders across every stage\054 providing leadership with real\055time progress visibility and cross\055departmental accountability\050\nAutomation \046 Systems Consultant \050Contractor\051\050Chocosol Traders \023 Toronto\054 Canada \174 Apr 2025\055 Current\050\050Projects\072\nModernizing systems and workflows to scale to 10x current production\nAutomated inventory transfer workflows integrating Katana \046 Shopify \055 across retail\054 wholesale\054 and events\050\nHighlights\072\n80\045 of inventory workflows\054 significantly reducing manual errors and giving easy visibility into demand and stock levels\nBuilt real\055time dashboards to track COGS\054 inventory performance\054 and financial metrics to evaluate ROI and guide operational decisions\050\nOperations Lead \050Full\055time\051\050Suppli \023 Toronto\054 Canada \174 Oct 2021\055 Apr 2025\050\050Projects\072\nBuilt custom Inventory Management Tool \222 45\045 less stockouts\nAutomated workflows \050API integration\051 \222\240cut ops hours by 55\045\nDesigned prediction model for catering orders \222\24095\045 demand accuracy\050\nHighlights\072\nScaled a circular reuse framework for 100\053 restaurants\054 20\053 corporate clients\054 and 70\053 return locations by managing end\055to\055end logistics across multiple 3PL and warehouse partners\nGained hands\055on exposure to major industry POS systems user interfaces\056\nLed analytics \046 KPI dashboards \222\24025\045 client growth\n\nProcess Engineer \057 Interim Transportation Manager \050Full\055time\051\050Future Foam Inc\056 \023 Dallas\054 USA \174 Jul 2018 \023 Mar 2021\050\nProjects\072\nTransportation optimization model \222\240\044120K annual savings\nERP implementation \053 training \222 improved adoption \046 data accuracy\n\050Highlights\072\nReduced\240material costs by 20\045\240via supplier negotiations\nManaged 20\053 production staff\054 optimized schedules to maximize workforce efficiency and reduce excess labor costs\nOversaw daily production schedules and procurement to\240meet a 3\055month demand forecast\n\050Quality Control \046 Lean Six Sigma Specialist \050Full\055time\051\050Digital Room Inc \023 Dallas\054 USA \174 Sep 2016 \023 May 2018\050\050Projects\072\nIntegrated tolerance margins \055 30\045 less reprints due to cutting errors\n\n\n\050\050\050\050\n\n\n)
     /K [ 4 ]
